LineComment   "// \"in\" over a range binds the 0-based position — the same key a list's index is"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// — not the element, so summing the positions of the five-element range(5, 10)"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// folds to 0 + 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = 10 (the positions), not the elements 5..9."
Newline       "\n"
